in-bottom:14px}.fill{height:100%;width:100%;background:␀␀␀␀;transform-origin:left;animation:prog ␀␀s linear forwards}@keyframes prog{from{transform:scaleX(0)}to{transform:scaleX(1)}}.back{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.back:hover{color:var(--text)}</style></head><body><div class='box'><span class='pill'>␀</span><h1>␀</h1><p>␀␀␀␀</p><div class='bar'><div class='fill'></div></div><a class='back' href='/'>Returning to console automatically...</a></div></body></html>␀␀␀text/html␀␀␀<div class='field'><span class='field-label'>␀␀␀</span><div class='seg' role='radiogroup'>␀␀<label><input type='radio' name='␀␀␀><span>␀</span></label>␀IDAT␀␀␀␀&amp;␀␀␀&lt;␀␀␀␀&gt;␀␀␀␀&quot;␀␀&#39;␀␀␀' type='␀␀␀␀ placeholder='␀␀admin␀␀␀/#panel-status␀␀no-store␀␀␀␀Diagnostics log cleared
